 enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature with flying enters the battlefield under your control, it gains haste until end of turn.\\nWhenever a Dragon enters the battlefield under your control, it deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of Dragons you control.', 'Whenever a creature with power 3 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.', 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Creatures your opponents control attack this turn if able.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, Midnight Reaper deals 1 damage to you and you draw a card.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Whenever an opponent attacks, if they attacked you and/or a planeswalker you control, draw a card.', "Whenever an opponent casts a spell, Kaervek the Merciless deals damage equal to that spell's mana value to any target.", 'Whenever another Zombie enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Champion of the Perished.', 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever you attack with three or more creatures, draw a card.', "Whenever you cast a spell from your hand, reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is that spell's mana value. You may cast a spell with mana value X or less from among cards revealed this way without paying its mana cost. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Guttersnipe deals 2 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.\\n{3}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'Worn Powerstone enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}.', 'You draw three cards and you lose 3 life.', 'You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is the number of creatures you control. Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'You gain X life and draw X cards.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'You may choose new targets for target instant or sorcery spell. Then copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'You may pay {W} and tap four untapped creatures you control with flying rather than pay this spell\'s mana cost.\\nFlying, lifelink\\nOther creatures you control with flying have indestructible. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', 'Zombies you control get +1/+0.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if a creature died this turn, you may pay {1}{B}. If you do, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Liliana's Mastery enters the battlefield, create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.", '[+1]: Mill three cards. If at least one Zombie card is milled this way, each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\n[−2]: Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of Zombies you control.\\n[−3]: You may cast Zombie spells from your graveyard this turn.', '[+1]: Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature.\\n[−3]: Target creature gains flying and double strike until end of turn.\\n[−8]: Create X 2/2 white Cat creature tokens, where X is your life total.', '[+1]: Until end of turn, Sarkhan, the Dragonspeaker becomes a legendary 4/4 red Dragon creature with flying, indestructible, and haste. (He doesn\'t lose loyalty while he\'s not a planeswalker.)\\n[−3]: Sarkhan, the Dragonspeaker deals 4 damage to target creature.\\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "At the beginning of your draw step, draw two additional cards" and "At the beginning of your end step, discard your hand."', '[+1]: You draw a card and you lose 1 life.\\n[−3]: Destroy target creature.\\n[−8]: Target opponent gets an emblem with "Whenever a player draws a card, you lose 2 life."', "[+2]: During target opponent's next turn, creatures that player controls attack Gideon Jura if able.\\n[−2]: Destroy target tapped creature.\\n[0]: Until end of turn, Gideon Jura becomes a 6/6 Human Soldier creature that's still a planeswalker. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to him this turn.", "{1}, {T}, Discard a card: Put a study counter on Grimoire of the Dead.\\n{T}, Remove three study counters from Grimoire of the Dead and sacrifice it: Put all creature cards from all graveyards onto the battlefield under your control. They're black Zombies in addition to their other colors and types.", '{1}, {T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{U}.', '{1}: Exile target card from a graveyard.', '{1}: You may cast target creature card in a graveyard this turn. When you cast it this turn, Havengul Lich gains all activated abilities of that card until end of turn.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Wayfarer's Bauble: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.", '{2}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{3}, Sacrifice Burnished Hart: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{3}, Sacrifice a creature or planeswalker: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{4}, {T}, Discard your hand: Draw a card for each creature you control.', '{G}: Exile target card from a graveyard. If it was a creature card, put a +1/+1 counter on Scavenging Ooze and you gain 1 life.', "{T}, Sacrifice Nihil Spellbomb: Exile target player's graveyard.\\nWhen Nihil Spellbomb is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may pay {B}. If you do, draw a card.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Draconic Disciple: Create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}. ({C} represents colorless mana.)\\n{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Molten Slagheap.\\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Molten Slagheap: Add X mana in any combination of {B} and/or {R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{B}{R}, {T}: Stensia Bloodhall deals 2 damage to target player or planeswalker.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Unstable Obelisk: Destroy target permanent.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a Dragon creature spell.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Haven of the Spirit Dragon: Return target Dragon creature card or Ugin planeswalker card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}. Talisman of Indulgence deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}. Talisman of Unity deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}. Talisman of Impulse deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}. Talisman of Dominance deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}. Talisman of Progress deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{W}{U}, {T}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Hedron Archive: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {G}. If you control four or more creatures, add {G}{G} instead.', '{T}: Add {R} or {G}.\\n{4}{R}{G}: Atarka Monument becomes a 4/4 red and green Dragon artifact creature with flying until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {W}.', '{T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you created a token this turn.\\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifice Idol of Oblivion: Create a 10/10 colorless Eldrazi creature token.', "{W}, Sacrifice Soul Snare: Exile target creature that's attacking you or a planeswalker you control."]
flavor: ['"Aether is the soul of Kaladesh, and all souls should be free."', '"Animals commune with their environment without the need for language. Theirs is a fundamental connection that surpasses flimsy words."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"Approach my tower on bended knee or depart from it as ash upon the wind."\\n—Gadwick, the Wizened', '"Arise, great one, and cleanse the world of our enemies!"', '"As one, nature lifts its voice to tell you this: \'No.\'"', '"As she reached the pinnacle, lightning flashed and her eyes blazed with newfound power."\\n—Legend of the Gilded Knights', '"Avacyn\'s protection is everywhere. From the holy church to the sacred glade, all that we see is under her blessed watch."', '"Conquering your first world is the hardest, after all. My power grew as I moved from world to world, taking anything that would make the next taking easier."\\n—Ob Nixilis', '"Daxos, I\'m in need of a champion. Who else would I turn to but you?"', '"Die. But die knowing that your pathetic life will yield a great bounty for me."\\n—Zul Ashur, lich lord', '"Even steel and stone return to Ghrin-Danu in time."\\n—Katilda, Dawnhart Prime', '"Even your shadow is too foul to tolerate."', '"Her hunger knows no limit. Left unchecked, she would feast on all of Tarkir."\\n—Yasova Dragonclaw', '"Here lies Gond, hero of Safehold Taldwen. May he ever guide our quest."', '"Heroism is more than a single act; it is hundreds of small decisions, made every day, in pursuit of a heroic cause."', '"Holy places are no longer sanctuary from death, and death is no longer sanctuary from anything."\\n—Thalia, Knight-Cathar', '"I am rooted in the life of all that thrives around me. You cannot move me."', '"I feel the vine-rhythm as my friends drive the beast to me. I will not miss my mark."', '"I found a new toy. Wanna play?"', '"I know they\'re unstoppable fighters created to harvest souls—it\'s just they\'re so rude about it."\\n—Kaya', '"I like burning and pillaging as much as anyone, but sometimes it\'s just easier to throw a rock and let the trolls do the work."\\n—Urik, Tuskeri raid leader', '"I prefer loyalty to be a matter of respect, not of magic. But one does what one must."\\n—Kaalia of the Vast', '"I prefer the big and looming to the small and skittering."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari shaman', '"I serve only justice. But through that duty, I serve all of Ravnica."', '"I want to help Zendikar. Show me the way."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"I would be a fool if I taught you everything I know."', '"I\'d stand back if I were you."', '"If I am to die, I will die in the embrace of immeasurable flame."', '"If you threaten its territory, it produces spores. Actually, no matter what you do, it produces spores."\\n—Hadi Kasten, Calla Dale naturalist', '"In these halls there is no pass or fail. Your true test comes with the first full moon."', '"Let all feel joy in pain."\\n—Rakdos', '"Let the knowledge of absolute law inspire you to live a life of absolute order."', '"Let their horrors and machines come. We will meet them blow for blow."', '"Like ribbons of wind and wisdom the coatls fly, twisting mystery into truth, shaping the clouds to suit their inscrutable will."\\n—Huatli', '"Long after the land has given up the last of its secrets, there will still be mysteries in the depths of the sea."\\n—Kiora', '"Madness can\'t touch a mind ignited by genius."', '"Many hands make light work."\\n—Ludevic, necro-alchemist', '"May all the cairns of Jund be toppled."\\n—Meren of Clan Nel Toth', '"May your day never match your expectations."\\n—Scriptus Fleen, flectomancer', '"Monster or human, my rate\'s the same."', '"Monsters dwell in every heart. We only think civilization tames them."\\n—Euphemia, Nexus watcher', '"Nature has a way of adapting to and overcoming any force that seeks its end."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"No doubt the arbiters would put you away, after all the documents are signed. But I will have justice now."\\n—Alovnek, Boros guildmage', '"No harm can come to me while the Worldsoul shelters me."', '"Odd. I didn\'t see any lightning . . . ."\\n—Herreth, poacher, last words', '"Oh, you fellas are going to love the lockup. Excellent gruel. Very low ceilings."\\n—Libuse, Boros sergeant', '"On vile wings and bloody wind, the swarm will rise."\\n—Skyclave inscription', '"Only cowards flee from the truth."\\n—Perisophia the philosopher', '"Our enemies have breached our realm. To survive, the clans must fight as one!"', '"Our forces number more than the leaves of Vitu-Ghazi. Do not provoke us."', '"Rats and jackals feast in his swath, but even they will not walk with him."\\n—Mangara', '"Shackle the body, and the anguish lasts only until death. Shackle the soul, and the wicked can be punished for eternity."\\n—Inquisitor Laerin', '"Spread out, you idiots! Spread out!"\\n—Marsden, party leader, last words', '"Surely it won\'t notice if I take—"\\n—Theria the Sly, last words', '"The arc of my blade has carved a path of light for the peace that will follow."', '"The beasts of the wild are my senses. It is through their eyes that all knowledge shall come to me."', '"The clamor of the city drowns all voices. But together we can sing a harmony that will resonate from Ravnica\'s tallest spires to her deepest wells."', '"The dragon is a perfect marriage of power and the will to use it."\\n—Sarkhan Vol', '"The living don\'t ever stay living, and the dead don\'t always stay dead."\\n—Jeddeg, philosopher of graves', '"The predator knows the true way of the world. Life is conflict. Only the strong survive."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"The specimen seems to be broken."', '"There are so many of them. It seems they\'ve just been waiting for someone to serve."', '"There is great wisdom in rushing headlong into combat . . . if you\'re prepared."\\n—Kenjek, captain of the Thousand Swords', '"There will come a day so dark you will pray for death. On that day your prayers will be answered."\\n-Minaldra, the Vizag Atum', '"These fiends are slightly less tolerable than you." "A sentiment that warms my heart, sister."', '"This world will be ruled by its rightful sovereigns, not these hideous pretenders."', '"To comprehend the full answer requires years of temporal study. In short, they were now never born in the first place."\\n—Teferi', '"To see past the veil of death, cross it."\\n—The Red Book of Mezdrithalik', '"To wage war, secure peace within yourself."\\n—Emmara', '"Verdant bloom does exist. It merely hides for its own safety."', '"We are one with the wild things. Life blooms from our fingertips and nature responds to our summons."\\n—Jade creed', '"We have intel that some guilds have fallen under an invader\'s influence. Until we\'re sure, no venture succeeds."\\n—Lazav', '"We speak the dragons\' language of flame and rage. They speak our language of fury and honor. Together we shall weave a tale of destruction without equal."', '"We train for the improbable, like lightning striking the same place twice, or striking everywhere at once."\\n—Nundari, Sea Gate militia captain', '"What was once formed by masons, shaped by smiths, or given life by mages, I will return to the embrace of the earth."', '"Whatever hatred destroys, a single act of trust can revive."', '"When you hear thunder on a cloudless day, take cover and brace for the coming of the storm herd."\\n—Skotov, Tin Street basket vendor', '"Where will you run when I punish you with the very ground you flee on?"\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Which would you like first, the insult or the injury?"', '"Why would I kill you all? Who then would be left to worship me?"', '"Within the song of Mat\'Selesnya, one becomes all."\\n—Heruj, Selesnya hierophant', '"You can come back once you\'ve learned some manners—and figured out how to reconstitute your physical forms."', '"You foolish knights pound your breastplates and vow to fight until your last breath. As if that\'s when it ends."\\n—Tormod, the Desecrator', '"You hit like a kobold!"', '"You think they know we\'re here?"\\n—Orlo, goblin raider', '"You\'ll bend to my will—with or without your precious sanity."', '"You\'ve begun to understand the hedrons\' true purpose," said Ugin. "The Eldrazi can be imprisoned."\\n"And how did that work out last time?" asked Jace.', '"You\'ve got how much gold there?"', '"Your mind is too filled with foolish concerns to hear the subtle whispers that the breeze brings."', '"Your presumption is your downfall."', "A knight's devotion to their steed goes only so far.", 'A lifetime of keeping up appearances is not enough to earn an eternity of rest.', 'A mudflow swallowed the lowlands years ago. All that remains are a bottomless mire and an endless rain of ash.', 'A trick of the light, though momentary, can still be deadly.', 'A true reflection of nature: death fostering life.', 'After lightning struck the cliffs, the ore became iron, the iron became steel, and the steel became greaves. The lightning never left.', 'After the Battle of Liet Field, the white sun crested above Taj-Nar, bringing hope to all who survived the carnage.', 'All seeds share a common bond, calling to each other across infinity.', 'All suns must set.', "All the aether charts in the world can't compete with the trained eye of a talented scout.", "All the birds of the skies are the spirit's brood, gathered for safety under its wings.", "An Atarka dragon's exhale cooks what its inhale consumes.", "An aven's gear is enchanted to avoid weighing them down during aerial maneuvers.", 'An emblem of a secret guild, the Dimir insignia is seen only by its own members—and the doomed.', "As they awakened, the Eldrazi reasserted their mastery over all of Zendikar's natural forces.", 'As they fought the Eldrazi, many vampires learned to live among humans. Others were unable to make the adjustment.', "At the general's triumphant return, renewed strength surged through the soldiers' ranks.", "Atarka is worshipped and fed by her subjects at Ayagor, the Dragon's Bowl.", 'Atarka serving-goblins coat themselves with grease imbued with noxious herbs, hoping to discourage their ravenous masters from adding them to the meal.', "Attracting a dragon's attention may be the last mistake you make.", "Baby dragons can't figure out humans—if they didn't want to be killed, why were they made of meat and treasure?", 'Beauty is in the eye of the exploder.', 'Caught between life and death, between land and sea, between thought and oblivion.', 'Deep in the heart of Urborg lie massive volcanoes whose thick black smoke covers the land with perpetual darkness.', 'Despite the chaos of the Roil and the devastation of the Eldrazi, Zendikar is a world of breathtaking beauty.', 'Despite their many forms, the Eternals worked in chilling harmony, unburdened by instinct or emotion.', 'Devils sow grief and harvest glee.', 'Each scar on its hide is a badge of honor.', "Elspeth's squires do not seek advancement. For them, no knightly glory could surpass the glory of serving their champion.", 'Even a fragment of a powerstone contains within it not just energy, but space—vast dimensions trapped in fragile crystal.', 'Even in areas of profound devastation, the hedrons remained intact.', 'Even the clouds became a field of battle. Known as the Sky Theater, it saw the Eternals clash with squadrons of angels.', 'Every grave cradles a recruit.', 'First, whispers of ancient days. Then, visions of things to come.', 'Fishing boats often follow hunting drakes to find the largest schools of fish.', 'Flavorful aromas beckon many a salivating maw.', 'Forged by divine hands to wander mortal realms.', 'Fortunately, the reanimation spell just missed the long-dead colony of dung scorpions.', "From deep in the caves beneath the forest, the hierophants planned the druids' raids against the enemy.", 'From the seeds of faith, great forests grow.', 'Fusing intelligence with the power of undeath requires inspiration of the darkest kind.', 'Grixis is a world where the only things found in abundance are death and decay. Corpses, whole or in part, are the standard currency among necromancers and demons.', 'He collects the precious metals, and then converts the rest to propellant.', 'He marks his territory with fire and wrath, etching the mountainside with his charring breath.', 'He relishes the devotion of his Skirsdag puppets and their belief that it will earn them immortality.', "He rose from the graf for every cobbler, tanner, and fool who'd been slaughtered in the parish—and they rose and shambled after him.", "He'd chosen a sunlit clearing with open skies and an ample brook. All that remained was to find a worthy sapling.", 'His blessing is a curse.', 'His roots reach deep and grip hard.', 'His words echo every roar, screech, and howl of the wilds.', 'In nature, not a single bone or scrap of flesh goes to waste.', 'In the autumn, she casts her seeds across the streets below, and come spring, her children rise in service to the Conclave.', 'In their final moments, the demons gazed upon grace in its purest form.', 'Infinite possibilities contained in a finite space.', 'Inscribed with runes that predate the dragon, its horns possess their own ancient magic.', 'Iroas and Mogis are as different in appearance as they are in personality.', 'It harmonizes with the essence of its master.', 'It is ancient, immense, and irresistible.', 'It is the forest beyond the horizon, the mountain waiting to be climbed, the new land across the endless sea.', 'It shambled from the cloud of ash and bone dust, undeterred by its own extinction.', 'It started as a mere drop of water. The Magic Mirror crystallized it into much more.', 'It was a night like any other. It would soon become a night no one would ever forget.', "It's the pinnacle of utter destructiveness.", 'Its collapse is like the lashing out of a long-dead civilization that resents being forgotten.', 'Its crystalline core refracts light into chaos.', 'Its wings shimmer with dreams absorbed from its enemies.', 'Knowledge brings the sting of disillusionment, but the pain teaches perspective.', 'Left to itself, nature overflows any container, overthrows any restriction, and overreaches any boundary.', 'Liliana inspires horror in many and fanatical admiration in a few.', 'Little agonies pave the way to greater power.', 'Llanowar has seven elfhames, or kingdoms, each with its own ruler. Their palaces are objects of awe, wonder, and envy.', "Lost to time is the artificer's art of trapping light from a distant star in a ring of purest gold.", 'Made of bone and boiled in blood, a Rakdos signet is not considered finished until it has been used as a murder weapon.', 'Magic written across the sky falls like rain on thirsty ground, bringing forth wisdom in its season.', "Might doesn't make right, but it does win the fight.", 'Mirko Vosk hunted anyone with knowledge of the maze, draining the chances of the other guilds.', "Nature doesn't walk.", 'Necromancers deal in commodities far more precious than gold and grain.', 'No one welcomes his visit, yet all must grant him tribute.', 'Nothing escapes its gaze—or its breath.', "Ob Nixilis decided the fastest way to seize control of New Capenna would be to usurp the networks of power already hidden there. Xander's Maestros were the first to fall.", 'On Evos Isle, the swift and formidable aven enforce the will of the ruling sphinxes.', 'On Innistrad, Liliana embraced necromancy, honing her powers by practicing on scores of undead—and sometimes the living.', 'On the continent of Tazeem, rushing waters plunge through narrow canyons into mist-cloaked lakes.', 'On the volcanic continent of Akoum, bizarre vegetation clusters around gas vents, and jagged mountain peaks rise high into the air.', 'Once it consecrated the dead. Now it desecrates them.', 'Only death breeds in stagnant water.\\n—Urborg saying', 'Only the hardiest explorers survive to eat the fruit.', "Oona's song is like a twisted dinner chime. All the faeries return home, but it is Oona who feasts—on the stolen dreams and rumors they serve her.", 'Panic spread like wildfire as the demons of Immersturm poured into Bretagard, slaughtering as they came.', "Scions of the Markov line take particular pleasure in the perversion of humans' holy rituals.", 'Senators of Azorius often hired agents to spy on the Selesnya. They were told to record every spore and root they saw, as each could become a deadly foe.', "She remembers every word spoken, from the hero's oath to the baby's cry.", 'She was born unable to walk. Through the eludha, she was able to fly.', 'Sometimes death comes knocking. Sometimes it tears down the walls.', 'Sounds of life beckon many a restless soul.', "Tazeem's embrace is harsh, but for those that call it home, nothing else will do.", 'The Capashen built the highest towers in Benalia to afford themselves the best view.', 'The Champion reached for a stone, and Heliod placed the sun into her hand.\\n—The Theriad', 'The Curse of Wandering leaves only hatred.', 'The Falkenrath progenitor was a vicious falconer, and the line is quick to remind others of its heritage.', 'The Hekma may repel storms and monsters, but nothing holds back the heat of the suns.', 'The Izzet mage knew she would neither get her thermoinverter back nor have the satisfaction of exploding it herself.', 'The Kargan tribes share legends of the victory their ancestors won over the Akoum Skyclave, and its horrendous cost.', 'The Quicksilver Sea hissed and bubbled at the indignity. The Vulshok shaman just smiled.', 'The Skelle spent days carving runes and erecting their scorn poles. The herd crushed them to splinters in seconds.', 'The arrows of the elvish elite strike as true and deadly as the fangs of the Cosmos Serpent they revere.', 'The best presents are impossible to regift.', "The biggest difference between a victory and a massacre is which side you're on.", 'The blood of the demons quickened as their master rose over the battlefield. The blood of the angels also quickened: here was the chance to finally end the war started millennia ago.', 'The bounty on its head is as old as Skysail, but no one has ever tried to collect.', 'The continent of Guul Draz is a geothermal swampland reeking of heat and decay.', 'The continent of Murasa lies beneath a blanket of dense vegetation, its enormous branches tangled so thickly that some inhabitants never see the ground.', 'The continent of Ondu is a vast plateau crisscrossed by deep trenches and meandering rivers.', "The dead know lessons the living haven't learned.", 'The defenders watched in terror as the flying V split apart into a bristling battle formation.', 'The essence of wind to lift up the weary.', "The harvest god's cornucopia contains the fruits of the fields, the forest, and beyond.", 'The kor send their thopter kites to see if the land is in a welcoming mood.', 'The maze-like design embodies the core of Azorius law—strict structure designed to test wills and stall change.', 'The municipal senate makes extensive use of the thopters, mostly to gather dirt on rival senators.', 'The pattern of life can be studied like a book, if you know how to read it.', 'The promise of anguish is payment enough for services rendered.', "The purple banner of the House of Vess is a symbol of death wherever it's flown.", 'The revelry ends when the supply of fresh ingenues runs dry.', 'The river split into many channels as it flowed to the Halimar Sea. Few travelers could follow the same one twice.', "The shaman looked at the world through Ghalta's eyes and understood that everything else was his prey.", 'The throng flitted from castle to castle, leaving a trail of star-crossed love, damaging rumors, and missing heirlooms in their wake.', 'The warlocks never expected their creations to create servants of their own.', 'The wills of mortals shift as the tide ebbs and flows.', "There's no stronger armor than the bravery of those beside you.", 'Those who are chosen do not doubt. Those who remain do not lament.', "Those who don't learn from their deaths are destined to repeat them.", 'Those who move harmoniously with the flow of aether can channel the power of the natural world.', 'Though its mind has long since rotted away, it wields a sword with deadly skill.', "Thunder doesn't always mean rain. Sometimes it means ruin.", "To be counted among the warriors of Setessa's Leina Tower, you must not fear death, only failure.", 'Until Emeria is freed, he raises his sword in her name.', "Warning to those who scale the cliffs without paying tribute: it's a long way down.", "When tempers run high, it's easy to lose your head.", 'When the earth shudders, the sky overflows.', 'When the winds blow out of the abyss, death is the only harvest.', 'Where the holy light of the angels has shone, only purity remains.', 'Whether mechanical or biological, life finds a way to propagate itself.', 'Yavimaya lights the quickest path to battle.', "Zombies work best when they're fed appropriately, so it's prudent to let them eat on the job."]
artist: ['Aaron J. Riley', 'Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Alayna Danner', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Alex Konstad', 'Allen Williams', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Andrew Goldhawk', 'Andrey Kuzinskiy', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Austin Hsu', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Caio Monteiro', 'Camille Alquier', 'Campbell White', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Ostrowski', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Chris Seaman', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Colin Boyer', 'Corey D. Macourek', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cristi Balanescu', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Gaillet', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Dominick Domingo', 'Dominik Mayer', 'Don Hazeltine', 'Donato Giancola', 'Ekaterina Burmak', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Evan Shipard', 'Evyn Fong', 'Eytan Zana', 'Filip Burburan', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Fred Fields', 'G-host Lee', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Staples', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Helge C. Balzer', 'Henry G. Higginbotham', 'Heonhwa Choe', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Ironbrush', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jana Schirmer & Johannes Voss', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jerry Tiritilli', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'Johan Grenier', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Julian Kok Joon Wen', 'Jung Park', 'Kai Carpenter', 'Kamila Szutenberg', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Kim Sokol', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lie Setiawan', 'Lindsey Look', 'Livia Prima', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Marta Nael', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Massimilano Frezzato', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Maxime Minard', 'Michael Bruinsma', 'Michael C. Hayes', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Dringenberg', 'Miles Johnston', 'Milivoj Ćeran', 'Min Yum', 'Nicholas Gregory', 'Nils Hamm', 'Néstor Ossandón Leal', 'Olivier Bernard', 'Omar Rayyan', 'Paul Bonner', 'Philip Straub', 'Piotr Dura', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Ravenna Tran', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robbie Trevino', 'Ron Spears', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Burley', 'Sara Winters', 'Sarah Finnigan', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Shreya Shetty', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Stephan Martiniere', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Sung Choi', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Tim Hildebrandt', 'Titus Lunter', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Tyler Walpole', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Vincent Evans', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'William Wu', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Wisnu Tan', 'Wylie Beckert', 'XiaoDi Jin', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yigit Koroglu', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zack Stella', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zoltan Boros', 'rk post']
